      "footnotes": [
        "Notes: 1. For guns 48 sets of artillery ammunition, spare parts and accessories were delivered.",
        "2. For machine-guns and rifles, spare parts and accessories were delivered.",
        "3. For shrapnel, timefuses were supplied.",
        "4. For trench mortars, charges and bottoms (fuzes) were delivered.",
        "There is no information as to the amount of arms and munitions delivered in 3 aeroplanes, aeroplane bombs; explosive bombs 200; incendiary bombs 100; fougasse bombs 100; shells 1,000.",
        "Note: From 4 December on began to arrive at Urga the shipments (for Feng Yu-hsiang) on account of Moscow's order of 16 November, as follows: rifles 25,000; cartridges 32 millions; machine guns (St. Etienne) 140; guns 42; shells 12,000; handgrenades 10,000; swords 5,000; bomb throwers 10; shells for bombthrowers 1,000; chemical shells 10,000; gasmasks 30,000; flame-throwers 10; aeroplanes 6; telephones 400; cables 150 pieces (?).",
        "With the exception of the underlined [italicized Ed.] items which are included in the above list, there is no information that those arms and munitions have been actually delivered to Feng Yu-hsiang.",
        "(Translator's Note: The above notation beginning from \"Note: From 4 December, etc.\" has been crossed out.)"
      ],
